* Infrastructure smoke: real SKY130 devices, no SRAM qualification.
.lib "{{MODEL}}" {{CORNER}}
.include "{{NETLIST}}"
.temp {{TEMP}}
VDD VDD 0 {{VDD}}
VIN A 0 PULSE(0 {{VDD}} 2n {{SLEW}} {{SLEW}} {{HIGH}} {{PERIOD}})
XINV A Y VDD 0 infra_inv
CLOAD Y 0 {{LOAD}}
.tran 10p 40n
.meas tran smoke_low FIND v(Y) AT=5n
.end
